# Phase 8B-1 - populated corpus files are heavy (tens of MB per
# source - 75 MB+ for pret-firered alone) and trivially reproducible
# from the on-disk source clones via `scripts/build-tile-intel-corpus.mjs`.
# Keep them out of git; the sidecar reads whichever files happen to
# be present.
#
# Re-generate from the repo root after cloning:
#   node scripts/build-tile-intel-corpus.mjs
#
# Defaults match the user's existing local clones; see --help for
# how to override paths.
*.json
!.gitignore
!README.md
